(7154935, 1097195, 86447, '<td valign="top">In my top four.  You got a 9 from me (earlier).    Very well done!</td>', 'In my top four.  You got a 9 from me (earlier).    Very well done!', '2014-01-09 15:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7154936, 1097357, 86447, '<td valign="top">Ha!  So fun!    8 from me (earlier).</td>', 'Ha!  So fun!    8 from me (earlier).', '2014-01-09 15:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7154971, 1097408, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''ve voted this an 8 (earlier).  I love the tones and the composition.  <br/>Does she always stick out her tongue to put food on it?   I think that''s the part that throws me off a bit... it seems contrived (as we all know that it is, but we don''t want to think that it is).  *grin*<br/> <br/>In any case, I think this will do well for you.<br/> <br/>Love the bit of backlighting, too.</td>', 'I''ve voted this an 8 (earlier).  I love the tones and the composition.  Does she always stick out her tongue to put food on it?   I think that''s the part that throws me off a bit... it seems contrived (as we all know that it is, but we don''t want to think that it is).  *grin* In any case, I think this will do well for you. Love the bit of backlighting, too.', '2014-01-09 15:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7154972, 1097267, 86447, '<td valign="top">Well done!  I''ve voted this an 8 (earlier).   Cleverly done thought up and technically wonderful.</td>', 'Well done!  I''ve voted this an 8 (earlier).   Cleverly done thought up and technically wonderful.', '2014-01-09 15:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155117, 1097233, 173844, '<td valign="top">Designed for transitional living, this elegantly alien-looking crab inhabits a zone of muck and gold.  The very unusual tones are fascinating, and the actual eye contact draws one in.</td>', 'Designed for transitional living, this elegantly alien-looking crab inhabits a zone of muck and gold.  The very unusual tones are fascinating, and the actual eye contact draws one in.', '2014-01-09 21:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155124, 1097324, 173844, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the transition but the image is so persuasively suggestive that I''ll take it on faith.</td>', 'I don''t understand the transition but the image is so persuasively suggestive that I''ll take it on faith.', '2014-01-09 21:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155130, 1097394, 173844, '<td valign="top">This commonplace transition seems to suggest that moment to moment life is a continual blur of transitions.  Every step we take.  This is an admirable portrayal of such a proposition.</td>', 'This commonplace transition seems to suggest that moment to moment life is a continual blur of transitions.  Every step we take.  This is an admirable portrayal of such a proposition.', '2014-01-09 21:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155134, 1097354, 173844, '<td valign="top">Along with this amazing sun behind cloud portrayal, it seems that storms are accompanying all this majesty.  So there are two classic transitions here ---weather and day/night.  Sweet.  But I''m not enamored of the foreground.</td>', 'Along with this amazing sun behind cloud portrayal, it seems that storms are accompanying all this majesty.  So there are two classic transitions here ---weather and day/night.  Sweet.  But I''m not enamored of the foreground.', '2014-01-09 21:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155143, 1097393, 83845, '<td valign="top">The color transition is beautiful and I love the PP!</td>', 'The color transition is beautiful and I love the PP!', '2014-01-09 22:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155144, 1097205, 83845, '<td valign="top">Lovely, but picturing a tighter crop... 6</td>', 'Lovely, but picturing a tighter crop... 6', '2014-01-09 22:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155326, 1097253, 82707, '<td valign="top">One of the more beautiful images in this comp.... But I think I recognise the wheat...  Is this Stag?  Hey, great lighting and nice idea.  I hope it does really, really well, because it deserves to.  Really lovely image.... no vote... and if this is not one of Stag''s, then I completely apologise... LOL!</td>', 'One of the more beautiful images in this comp.... But I think I recognise the wheat...  Is this Stag?  Hey, great lighting and nice idea.  I hope it does really, really well, because it deserves to.  Really lovely image.... no vote... and if this is not one of Stag''s, then I completely apologise... LOL!', '2014-01-10 06:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155440, 1097229, 174126, '<td valign="top">Well composed</td>', 'Well composed', '2014-01-10 12:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155443, 1097417, 174126, '<td valign="top">simple, effective. Might work better as a single block, and avoid ''puddle'' on right</td>', 'simple, effective. Might work better as a single block, and avoid ''puddle'' on right', '2014-01-10 12:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155444, 1097401, 174126, '<td valign="top">pity the snow so trodden, lovely approach.</td>', 'pity the snow so trodden, lovely approach.', '2014-01-10 12:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155445, 1097267, 174126, '<td valign="top">Very effective</td>', 'Very effective', '2014-01-10 12:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155446, 1097332, 174126, '<td valign="top">Like the vapours off the oil lamp, very well lit</td>', 'Like the vapours off the oil lamp, very well lit', '2014-01-10 12:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155448, 1097357, 174126, '<td valign="top">Great expression on the lad.</td>', 'Great expression on the lad.', '2014-01-10 12:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155449, 1097366, 174126, '<td valign="top">Very good image and idea. Wonder how it looked with less light from our side of the door?</td>', 'Very good image and idea. Wonder how it looked with less light from our side of the door?', '2014-01-10 12:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155562, 1097266, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful range of blues, and then the beach continuing into the shallows.  Unusual pier, perhaps a bit over-centered, stitches the transition together.  Wide angle suits this lovely expanse.</td>', 'Beautiful range of blues, and then the beach continuing into the shallows.  Unusual pier, perhaps a bit over-centered, stitches the transition together.  Wide angle suits this lovely expanse.', '2014-01-10 16:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155563, 1097234, 173844, '<td valign="top">Transitions not only of day/night but also work/off work.  Strong sunrise, delicate silhouette and contrails resembling crepuscular rays.</td>', 'Transitions not only of day/night but also work/off work.  Strong sunrise, delicate silhouette and contrails resembling crepuscular rays.', '2014-01-10 16:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155675, 1097404, 108069, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool. Processing treatment is quite nice.</td>', 'Pretty cool. Processing treatment is quite nice.', '2014-01-10 23:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155676, 1097181, 108069, '<td valign="top">Certainly captures cold and windy. I think there''s a lot going on and if I were to study it simply to be nit-picky I''d probably say it was really busy, but I really like it.</td>', 'Certainly captures cold and windy. I think there''s a lot going on and if I were to study it simply to be nit-picky I''d probably say it was really busy, but I really like it.', '2014-01-10 23:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155685, 1097253, 30712, '<td valign="top">A very beautiful still life that says it all.  I love the lighting.</td>', 'A very beautiful still life that says it all.  I love the lighting.', '2014-01-11 02:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155741, 1097360, 173844, '<td valign="top">A moody sky showcases that particular phenomenon of a rainbow separating the sky into light and dark -- a very mysterious transition.  The yellow tree (weeping willow?) is perfectly set off before the blue sky.  I wonder what the light dots and streaks amidst and below the rainbow are?</td>', 'A moody sky showcases that particular phenomenon of a rainbow separating the sky into light and dark -- a very mysterious transition.  The yellow tree (weeping willow?) is perfectly set off before the blue sky.  I wonder what the light dots and streaks amidst and below the rainbow are?', '2014-01-11 07:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155742, 1097412, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is such a clever idea, and title, with the transition being artificially produced with camera technique.  I very much like the ghostliness of both the ''limo'' and the backing woods.</td>', 'This is such a clever idea, and title, with the transition being artificially produced with camera technique.  I very much like the ghostliness of both the ''limo'' and the backing woods.', '2014-01-11 07:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155743, 1097402, 173844, '<td valign="top">I''m unable to figure this image out, but it sure does pique my interest.  I''d like to learn more about it.</td>', 'I''m unable to figure this image out, but it sure does pique my interest.  I''d like to learn more about it.', '2014-01-11 08:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155744, 1097275, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely line of trees against the blue and white sky, with a golden expanse of withered grass before it. The man on the bench, with the hefty backpack and walking stick, re-echoes the metaphor of passing time.  Both pretty and wistful.  Some halos on tree trunks.</td>', 'Lovely line of trees against the blue and white sky, with a golden expanse of withered grass before it. The man on the bench, with the hefty backpack and walking stick, re-echoes the metaphor of passing time.  Both pretty and wistful.  Some halos on tree trunks.', '2014-01-11 08:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155746, 1096809, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image of childhood and its emotional transitions.  The children outside, the bright flashes  of firecrackers, the reflection in the window --- all that come together gloriously. A favorite.</td>', 'Beautiful image of childhood and its emotional transitions.  The children outside, the bright flashes  of firecrackers, the reflection in the window --- all that come together gloriously. A favorite.', '2014-01-11 08:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155747, 1097105, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice, serene sunset image.  I particularly like  the metallic tone of the rocks.  Less sky might alleviate that halfway water horizon aspect, in my opinion.</td>', 'Very nice, serene sunset image.  I particularly like  the metallic tone of the rocks.  Less sky might alleviate that halfway water horizon aspect, in my opinion.', '2014-01-11 08:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155748, 1097304, 173844, '<td valign="top">No one said the transition can''t be abrupt.  This in your face image really illustrates that.  I like how, within this stoppage of traffic, the wires arcing between the telephone poles brings a sense of motion to the scene.</td>', 'No one said the transition can''t be abrupt.  This in your face image really illustrates that.  I like how, within this stoppage of traffic, the wires arcing between the telephone poles brings a sense of motion to the scene.', '2014-01-11 08:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155749, 1097406, 173844, '<td valign="top">Well portrayed.  The use of black and white adds to this image''s emotional depth.</td>', 'Well portrayed.  The use of black and white adds to this image''s emotional depth.', '2014-01-11 08:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155750, 1096967, 173844, '<td valign="top">Artfully and starkly shown fundamental, primitive transition.  I like how the spider webs lattice the entire frame.</td>', 'Artfully and starkly shown fundamental, primitive transition.  I like how the spider webs lattice the entire frame.', '2014-01-11 08:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155751, 1097388, 173844, '<td valign="top">Ah, transition of transitions.  In my opinion, this image would be greatly improved by situating the central figure more to the left.</td>', 'Ah, transition of transitions.  In my opinion, this image would be greatly improved by situating the central figure more to the left.', '2014-01-11 08:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155752, 1097278, 173844, '<td valign="top">Cool, colorful image.  Also, as the gentleman on the left illustrates, the transition from relative ignorance to knowledge. While the massive black girder serves to set apart the man, it also seems to loom a bit large.</td>', 'Cool, colorful image.  Also, as the gentleman on the left illustrates, the transition from relative ignorance to knowledge. While the massive black girder serves to set apart the man, it also seems to loom a bit large.', '2014-01-11 08:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155754, 1097209, 173844, '<td valign="top">The march of time.</td>', 'The march of time.', '2014-01-11 08:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155756, 1097403, 173844, '<td valign="top">Why''d the crack cross the road?  To illustrate the upheavals of time and weather.  Well-composed shot with a heightened sparkle to it.  I like the inky background.</td>', 'Why''d the crack cross the road?  To illustrate the upheavals of time and weather.  Well-composed shot with a heightened sparkle to it.  I like the inky background.', '2014-01-11 08:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155757, 1097379, 173844, '<td valign="top">Good study with handsome, evocative bokeh.</td>', 'Good study with handsome, evocative bokeh.', '2014-01-11 08:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155759, 1097136, 173844, '<td valign="top">This seemingly ordinary scene is pleasingly composed and balanced.  The vehicles are seamlessly coordinated and the streetlamps, traffic signs and signals and supporting arms are a balletic mobile.  Lovely gray sky.  A personal favorite.</td>', 'This seemingly ordinary scene is pleasingly composed and balanced.  The vehicles are seamlessly coordinated and the streetlamps, traffic signs and signals and supporting arms are a balletic mobile.  Lovely gray sky.  A personal favorite.', '2014-01-11 08:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155797, 1097253, 173844, '<td valign="top">Well-lit, handsomely presented still life.  Classic, almost alchemical, transition.</td>', 'Well-lit, handsomely presented still life.  Classic, almost alchemical, transition.', '2014-01-11 12:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155799, 1097293, 173844, '<td valign="top">Death, I suppose.  Very pleasing composition of shapes and tones.  I like how the figure is silhouetted at the bottom of a narrow staircase.</td>', 'Death, I suppose.  Very pleasing composition of shapes and tones.  I like how the figure is silhouetted at the bottom of a narrow staircase.', '2014-01-11 12:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155810, 1097377, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great depth, from mountain to mountains across a lower lying lake.  <br/>Geographical transition.  The ski lift framing on the left doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Great depth, from mountain to mountains across a lower lying lake.  Geographical transition.  The ski lift framing on the left doesn''t work for me.', '2014-01-11 13:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155814, 1097229, 173844, '<td valign="top">Splashy male, drab females.</td>', 'Splashy male, drab females.', '2014-01-11 13:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155815, 1097298, 173844, '<td valign="top">Bizarre transition.  Thanks for showing this.</td>', 'Bizarre transition.  Thanks for showing this.', '2014-01-11 13:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155817, 1096822, 173844, '<td valign="top">Amusing, but absolutely true, take on the challenge.  Direct portrait with lots of character.  I like the glasses.</td>', 'Amusing, but absolutely true, take on the challenge.  Direct portrait with lots of character.  I like the glasses.', '2014-01-11 13:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155820, 1097371, 173844, '<td valign="top">Though deteriorating, still has a lovely glow amidst the snow field in sunset.  This picture would be improved without inclusion of the roadside berm.</td>', 'Though deteriorating, still has a lovely glow amidst the snow field in sunset.  This picture would be improved without inclusion of the roadside berm.', '2014-01-11 13:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155830, 1097401, 173844, '<td valign="top">Appealing, ritualistic feel.</td>', 'Appealing, ritualistic feel.', '2014-01-11 14:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155831, 1097347, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, gleaming image highlighting another man-made tragedy that remains unresolved due to unfathomable greed and self-interest.  Great icecap on the foreground rock.</td>', 'Beautiful, gleaming image highlighting another man-made tragedy that remains unresolved due to unfathomable greed and self-interest.  Great icecap on the foreground rock.', '2014-01-11 14:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155832, 1097267, 173844, '<td valign="top">Clever contrast.</td>', 'Clever contrast.', '2014-01-11 14:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155833, 1096950, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fascinating take on soap bubbles.  Frozen iridescence.</td>', 'Fascinating take on soap bubbles.  Frozen iridescence.', '2014-01-11 14:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7155835, 1097413, 173844, '<td valign="top">I haven''t been able to figure this one out.</td>', 'I haven''t been able to figure this one out.', '2014-01-11 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
